      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stratford-upon-Avon",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Bear Pit Theatre, opened in 2008, remains a volunteer‑run venue celebrating local drama.",
